{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE Curry SIMULATOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep stirring. Never stop. Never let it burn.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>THE Curry SIMULATOR</i>, your sole mission is simple yet intense: stir the curry without letting it burn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a relaxing, almost meditative action quickly becomes a test of focus and endurance. One slip, one moment of hesitation\u2014and it\u2019s game over. Precision, rhythm, and quick reactions are your greatest allies in this deceptively simple simulation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive controls that anyone can pick up instantly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global online leaderboard \u2013 compete with curry stirrers from around the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addictive gameplay loop focused on mastery through simplicity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frequent updates and improvements during Early Access based on community feedback</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who Is This Game For?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of simple-but-hard-to-master games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players looking for a unique, high-score challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People who love curry, cooking, or just weirdly specific simulations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone who thinks stirring curry <i>should</i> be an eSport</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What\u2019s Next?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Early Access, the core gameplay and global leaderboard are already fully functional.<br>We plan to expand the game with additional difficulty options, visual polish, and new gameplay variations in future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us now, and become the world\u2019s ultimate curry stirrer.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepageback