<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People who love curry, cooking, or just weirdly specific simulations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone who thinks stirring curry <i>should</i> be an eSport</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What\u2019s Next?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Early Access, the core gameplay and global leaderboard are already fully functional.<br>We plan to expand the game with additional difficulty options, visual polish, and new gameplay variations in future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us now, and become the world\u2019s ultimate curry stirrer.</p>","developers":["Curry Lab"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646310/7c0f620d442e36fd69ea8473b1b7a66aa950f467/header.jpg?t=1754640011","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3646310/285673181/60de10aa1c5ccdf3592cb7cc4cf864b03dd7abac/1753353241/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753354701","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3646310/285673181/60de10aa1c5ccdf3592cb7cc4cf864b03dd7abac/1753353241/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753354701","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3646310/285673181/60de10aa1c5ccdf3592cb7cc4cf864b03dd7abac/1753353241/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753354701","id":257173331,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173331/movie480.mp4?t=1753354701","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173331/movie_max.mp4?t=1753354701"},"name":"curry","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257173331/e8b0c82105c7d34a0a1231192039191bd789a4de/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753354701","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173331/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753354701","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/s